Subject: [PATCH 2087/2087] Coverity Fix

---
 common/expr.c     |  4 ++++
 nslcd/attmap.c    |  4 +++-
 nslcd/cfg.c       | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++++------
 nslcd/daemonize.c | 56 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-------------------
 nslcd/myldap.c    | 47 ++++++++++++++++++++++-----------------
